        <section id="ai"><h2>6. Optional AI</h2><p>Ask AI replies require your explicit confirmation of the disclosed provider sharing. AI responses can be inaccurate or incomplete. Check important housing, account and transaction information through the relevant PineVela records or authorized people.</p><p>The assistant cannot authorize payments, approve applications or change housing allocations. Service limits and provider availability may affect whether it can reply.</p></section>
        <section id="availability"><h2>7. Service changes and restrictions</h2><p>Features may change or be temporarily unavailable because of maintenance, provider outages or service limits. Access may be restricted through the applicable security, safety and account-review processes. Contact support for help with an access or moderation decision.</p><p>Ending or closing a particular account context does not necessarily cancel an existing obligation or erase retained housing, transaction or support records.</p><p>These terms are governed by the laws of Ghana, subject to any mandatory legal protections that apply to you. Contact <a href="mailto:pinevela@pinevela.app">pinevela@pinevela.app</a> to raise a dispute and seek a resolution. This contact process does not limit any right to approach a competent authority or court.</p></section>
        <section id="privacy"><h2>8. Privacy, updates and contact</h2><p>Read the <a href="/privacy.html">privacy policy</a> for information about account data, Google sign-in, service providers and AI features. The date above identifies this version of the terms. Material changes will be communicated through the service or other appropriate notices before they apply to your continued use.</p><p>Operator: <strong>PineVela Ghana</strong>. Questions about these terms, your account or a transaction: <a href="mailto:pinevela@pinevela.app">pinevela@pinevela.app</a>.</p></section>
      </article>'
  ) then
    raise exception 'The 2026-11-05 Terms registry content differs from the reviewed document';
  end if;
end
